@host = https://localhost:7189

### Available sign-in methods
GET {{host}}/api/auth/drivers

### Stage 1: primary credentials (driver: LocalDatabase | ActiveDirectory | LinuxPam)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "<password from first-run log>",
  "driver": "LocalDatabase"
}

### Stage 2: TOTP (only when stage 1 returned status MfaRequired)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/mfa/verify-totp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mfaToken": "{{login.response.body.$.mfaToken}}",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Enabled modules
GET {{host}}/api/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Inventory
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
